{"id":"tournant","lemma":"tournant","pos":"adj","rank":4409,"glosses":["turning","revolving (door)","swivel (chair)"],"ipa":"/tuʁ.nɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/97/Fr-tournant.ogg/Fr-tournant.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"tournante","masculinePlural":"tournants","femininePlural":"tournantes"},"formAudio":{"tournante":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-tournante.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je pense que c'est un tournant.","en":"I think that this is a turning point.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Tu peux ajuster la couleur sur la télé en tournant ce bouton.","en":"You can adjust the color on the TV by turning this knob.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to adjust"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"color/colour"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"TV, telly"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"button"}]},{"text":"Zurich est réputé être une plaque tournante financière majeure.","en":"Zürich is considered to be a major financial hub.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to repute","l":"réputer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"sheet, plate"},null,{"g":"financier","l":"financier"},{"g":"greater","l":"majeur"}]}]}